  "body": "### Summary\n\nWanted by LOT-034 (#61) and LOT-035 (#62): the LOT-003 oracle covers one settings combination only; re-run the legacy exporter with the other settings (no new page capture), and find the deepest quote/tag nesting HFR serves (robustness bound is 10 000 levels).\n\n### Before you start\n\nRead AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/FIXTURES.md, tooling/fixtures/README.md, docs/lots/LOT-001-*.md and LESSONS 33/34/36/39. Write captures need the operator's approval first. Anonymize, independent leak check, Fable corpus review before any push.\n",
