   "body": "Add to this re-run: export legacy's **`isFavoritesOrRead`** link and `isRedFlagged` state (`HFRswift/Wrapped/MessagesTableViewController.m:1559-1566` at `2440d79`) in the LOT-003 oracle. It covers the topic captures that carry a function-bar `delflag` link: P03m, R63a, R63e, R21, R32b, R33b, R61d and R61e.\n\nWith that export, the #306 parser (PR #332) can get a differential test on the overlap: the red flag, where the bar link is also the first `delflag` link of the page. The rest is an intentional difference (LOT-033 spec, difference 5). This was asked by a CodeRabbit comment on #332.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
