   "body": "Done in #387 (merged as 4b6dbd4cd7dec94753e10d0eb442e011b227206f). This was partial work (`Refs #268`), so the issue stays open.\n\n**Done**\n- The LOT-003 oracle exports legacy's `isFavoritesOrRead`, `isRedFlagged` and `isUnreadable` (`result.fastAnswer`) for every topic case.\n- New folders:\n  - `Fixtures/LOT-003-flag/` holds R33b, R61d, R61e, R63a and R63e.\n  - `Fixtures/LOT-003-settings/` holds R21 with `display_sig: yes`, `display_images: no` and `embedded_videos: no`; R26 with `display_sig: yes`; and R28 with `display_images: no` and `embedded_videos: no`.\n\n**Left**\n- The deepest quote/tag nesting HFR serves. It needs a new live capture, which requires the operator's go per FIXTURES.md.\n- Differential tests that consume `LOT-003-settings/` belong to LOT-034 and LOT-035.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
